{"id":25,"date":"2026-09-23T13:29:48","date_gmt":"2026-09-23T13:29:48","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/booking\/","raw":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/booking\/"},"modified":"2026-10-14T08:35:36","modified_gmt":"2026-10-14T08:35:36","password":"","slug":"travel","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/travel\/","title":{"raw":"Travel","rendered":"Travel"},"content":{"raw":"<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-lead\">Whether you are planning a holiday, a city break, a business trip or a pilgrimage, MedLuxLife takes care of the details: holiday packages, hotels, flight tickets, airport transfers and Hajj and Umrah journeys, all planned around you.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section medlux-rows\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section medlux-rows\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our travel services<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"medlux-row\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns medlux-row\"><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"medlux-row-media\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column medlux-row-media\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1871,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-row-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-row-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/travel-holiday-packages-card.jpg\" alt=\"Couple relaxing by an infinity pool overlooking the sea\" class=\"wp-image-1871\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-row-text\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center medlux-row-text\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Holiday Packages<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tailor-made holidays at the coast, in historic cities or in quiet resorts, planned around your wishes and travel dates.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Tailor-made itineraries<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Seaside, city and wellness holidays<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Packages for couples, families and groups<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<!-- \/wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/travel\/holiday-packages\/\">Discover Holiday Packages<\/a><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:button --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:buttons --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"medlux-row medlux-row\\u002d\\u002dreverse\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns medlux-row medlux-row--reverse\"><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"medlux-row-media\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column medlux-row-media\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1860,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-row-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-row-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/hotel-reservation-intro.jpg\" alt=\"Guests checking in at an elegant hotel reception\" class=\"wp-image-1860\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-row-text\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center medlux-row-text\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hotel Reservation<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Carefully selected hotels in the city or region of your choice, from comfortable city hotels to five-star resorts.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>City hotels, resorts and boutique hotels<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Rooms and suites for families and groups<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Special requests passed on to the hotel<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<!-- \/wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/travel\/hotel-reservation\/\">Discover Hotel Reservation<\/a><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:button --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:buttons --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"medlux-row\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns medlux-row\"><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"medlux-row-media\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column medlux-row-media\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1863,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-row-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-row-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/flight-tickets-intro.jpg\" alt=\"Passenger aircraft flying above the clouds at sunset\" class=\"wp-image-1863\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-row-text\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center medlux-row-text\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Flight Tickets<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Domestic and international flight tickets for holidays, business trips and family visits, with personal advice and support.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Domestic and international flights<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>One-way, return and multi-city tickets<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Group bookings, changes and rebooking<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<!-- \/wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/travel\/flight-tickets\/\">Discover Flight Tickets<\/a><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:button --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:buttons --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"medlux-row medlux-row\\u002d\\u002dreverse\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns medlux-row medlux-row--reverse\"><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"medlux-row-media\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column medlux-row-media\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1872,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-row-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-row-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/travel-airport-transfer-card.jpg\" alt=\"Driver loading luggage into a private van at the airport\" class=\"wp-image-1872\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-row-text\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center medlux-row-text\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Airport Transfer<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A private driver meets you at the airport and takes you to your hotel, and we arrange transfers for excursions and back to the airport.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Private meet-and-greet at arrival<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Hotel, city and excursion transfers<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Comfortable vehicles for every group size<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<!-- \/wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/travel\/airport-transfer\/\">Discover Airport Transfer<\/a><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:button --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:buttons --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"medlux-row\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns medlux-row\"><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"medlux-row-media\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column medlux-row-media\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1868,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-row-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-row-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/hajj-umrah-intro.jpg\" alt=\"Pilgrims around the Kaaba in Mecca at dusk\" class=\"wp-image-1868\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-row-text\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center medlux-row-text\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hajj &amp; Umrah<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Calm, well-organised Umrah and Hajj journeys with licensed partners, including visa guidance, flights, hotels near the holy sites and transfers.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Umrah journeys throughout the year<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Hajj with licensed partners, subject to quotas<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Hotels near the holy mosques<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<!-- \/wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/travel\/hajj-umrah\/\">Discover Hajj &amp; Umrah<\/a><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:button --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:buttons --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:columns --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How it works<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-steps\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Tell us your plans<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Share your dates, destination and wishes, and who will travel with you.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal offer<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We prepare a tailored proposal for flights, hotel and transfers, without obligation.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Booking and documents<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Once you agree, we make the bookings