s and rebooking<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/travel\/flight-tickets\/\">Discover Flight Tickets<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns medlux-row medlux-row--reverse is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-e35d3e13 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column medlux-row-media is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-row-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1600\" height=\"893\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/travel-airport-transfer-card.jpg\" alt=\"Driver loading luggage into a private van at the airport\" class=\"wp-image-1872\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/travel-airport-transfer-card.jpg 1600w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/travel-airport-transfer-card-300x167.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/travel-airport-transfer-card-1024x572.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/travel-airport-transfer-card-768x429.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/travel-airport-transfer-card-1536x857.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/travel-airport-transfer-card-18x10.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center medlux-row-text is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Airport Transfer<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A private driver meets you at the airport and takes you to your hotel, and we arrange transfers for excursions and back to the airport.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Private meet-and-greet at arrival<\/li>\n\n<li>Hotel, city and excursion transfers<\/li>\n\n<li>Comfortable vehicles for every group size<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/travel\/airport-transfer\/\">Discover Airport Transfer<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns medlux-row is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-e35d3e13 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column medlux-row-media is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-row-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1600\" height=\"893\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/hajj-umrah-intro.jpg\" alt=\"Pilgrims around the Kaaba in Mecca at dusk\" class=\"wp-image-1868\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/hajj-umrah-intro.jpg 1600w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/hajj-umrah-intro-300x167.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/hajj-umrah-intro-1024x572.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/hajj-umrah-intro-768x429.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/hajj-umrah-intro-1536x857.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/hajj-umrah-intro-18x10.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center medlux-row-text is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hajj &amp; Umrah<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Calm, well-organised Umrah and Hajj journeys with licensed partners, including visa guidance, flights, hotels near the holy sites and transfers.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Umrah journeys throughout the year<\/li>\n\n<li>Hajj with licensed partners, subject to quotas<\/li>\n\n<li>Hotels near the holy mosques<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/travel\/hajj-umrah\/\">Discover Hajj &amp; Umrah<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How it works<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Tell us your plans<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Share your dates, destination and wishes, and who will travel with you.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal offer<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We prepare a tailored proposal for flights, hotel and transfers, without obligation.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Booking and documents<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Once you agree, we make the bookings and send you all travel documents.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Support during your trip<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p cl